<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43632" root="&#xA;                        مضى&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْضَاهُ</span></b> 
                         [(assumed tropical:)  <i>He made it</i> (i. e., a contract, sale,
oath, &amp;c.) <i>to take effect; executed it; performed
it.</i>] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْضَى الأَمْرَ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَى عَلَى الأَمْرِ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْضَى اليَمِينَ</span>
                        <i>He made the oath to be unconditional, without exception, absolutely</i> or <i>decisively</i> or <i>irreversibly binding.</i> (TK voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَزَمَ</span>.)
See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَزَمَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْضَى عَهْدَهُ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>He made his covenant,
or contract, or the like, to have,</i> or <i>take, effect;
executed or performed it.</i> (L, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نفذ</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْضَى رَأْيًا</span>
                        <i>He formed,</i> or <i>gave, a decided
opinion.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْضَى</span>
                        <i>He signed</i> a writing <i>with his
name,</i> and so rendered it effective. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b7-  See 1.

